{"4901780": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Golfcremental", "steam_appid": 4901780, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4915990], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a golf course using golf course pieces. Sometimes normal, sometimes wacky, always profitable. Use pieces like ramps, half pipes, corners, black holes, funnels, speed boosts, swiss cheese blocks, dirt mounds, and much more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4901780/extras/71c7b3ea58932f527df2204ec02e56b3.poster.avif?t=1783916183\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4901780/extras/71c7b3ea58932f527df2204ec02e56b3.webm?t=1783916183\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4901780/extras/71c7b3ea58932f527df2204ec02e56b3.mp4?t=1783916183\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GOLF!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get a hole in one on your newly constructed golf course to start making money. Money made is calculated by which pieces the ball interacts with before it lands in the hole. Sometimes you can cheat this system in unique and creative ways to make way more money than I originally intended. So make sure to experiment with weird builds!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4901780/extras/661ee6066dea5430ddaffa13fe5111f1.poster.avif?t=1783916183\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4901780/extras/661ee6066dea5430ddaffa13fe5111f1.webm?t=1783916183\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4901780/extras/661ee6066dea5430ddaffa13fe5111f1.mp4?t=1783916183\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EARN!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain money passively while the hole recreates your hole in one repeatedly. Sit idle while your dollar bills stack up to the ceiling or reinvest your money into more expensive pieces to make more complicated builds. You can figure out your next course layout while making money at the same time! Now that's what I call &quot;ECONOMY&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4901780/extras/0c7cb08f4e3c69c0e76152e1e545a17a.poster.avif?t=1783916183\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4901780/extras/0c7cb08f4e3c69c0e76152e1e545a17a.webm?t=1783916183\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4901780/extras/0c7cb08f4e3c69c0e76152e1e545a17a.mp4?t=1783916183\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUY!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock more pieces that you can use in your golf courses. The patented (not officially patented) TIER SYSTEM allows you to unlock upgrades in bulk. Each tier gets way more expensive than the last but the more expensive it is, the  cooler the items it contains AND the more money those cool items make.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a golf course using golf course pieces. Sometimes normal, sometimes wacky, always profitable. Use pieces like ramps, half pipes, corners, black holes, funnels, speed boosts, swiss cheese blocks, dirt mounds, and much more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4901780/extras/71c7b3ea58932f527df2204ec02e56b3.poster.avif?t=1783916183\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4901780/extras/71c7b3ea58932f527df2204ec02e56b3.webm?t=1783916183\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4901780/extras/71c7b3ea58932f527df2204ec02e56b3.mp4?t=1783916183\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GOLF!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get a hole in one on your newly constructed golf course to start making money. Money made is calculated by which pieces the ball interacts with before it lands in the hole. Sometimes you can cheat this system in unique and creative ways to make way more money than I originally intended. So make sure to experiment with weird builds!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4901780/extras/661ee6066dea5430ddaffa13fe5111f1.poster.avif?t=1783916183\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps